  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "You are given a string SSS consisting of lowercase English letters.\n\nCount the number of ways to break the string SSS into 333 strings P,Q,P, Q,P,Q, and RRR such that:\n\n\nConcatenating P,Q,P, Q,P,Q, and RRR in order produces SSS, i.e., P+Q+R=SP + Q + R = SP+Q+R=S;\nConcatenating PPP and RRR in order produces QQQ, i.e., P+R=QP + R = QP+R=Q.\nNote that P,Q,RP, Q, RP,Q,R may be empty strings.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line of input will contain a single integer TTT, denoting the number of test cases.\nEach test case contains a string SSS consisting of lowercase English letters.\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, output on a new line, a single integer denoting the number of ways to break the string such that the given conditions are met.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤1051 \\le T \\le 10^51≤T≤105",
      "1≤∣S∣≤3⋅1051 \\le |S| \\le 3 \\cdot 10^51≤∣S∣≤3⋅105",
      "The sum of ∣S∣|S|∣S∣ over all test cases does not exceed 3⋅1053 \\cdot 10^53⋅105."
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
    "notes": [],
    "sampleTestCases": [
      {
        "id": "sample_1",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "3\naabb\naaaaaa\nabcdefg",
        "output": "1\n4\n0",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 1: Consider P=aP = \\text{a}P=a, Q=abQ = \\text{ab}Q=ab, R=bR = \\text{b}R=b. Thus,\n\nP+Q+R=a+ab+b=aabb=SP + Q + R = \\text{a} + \\text{ab} + \\text{b} = \\text{aabb} = SP+Q+R=a+ab+b=aabb=S;\nP+R=a+b=ab=QP + R = \\text{a} + \\text{b} = \\text{ab} = QP+R=a+b=ab=Q.\n\nIt can be shown that this is the only way to break the string such that the conditions are met.\nTest case 2: The 444 triplets of P,Q,RP, Q, RP,Q,R which satisfy the conditions: (,aaa,aaa),(a,aaa,aa),(aa,aaa,a),(aaa,aaa,)( \\text{} , \\text{aaa}, \\text{aaa}), (\\text{a}, \\text{aaa}, \\text{aa}), (\\text{aa}, \\text{aaa}, \\text{a}), (\\text{aaa}, \\text{aaa}, \\text{})(,aaa,aaa),(a,aaa,aa),(aa,aaa,a),(aaa,aaa,).\nNote that PPP is an empty string in (,aaa,aaa)(\\text{}, \\text{aaa}, \\text{aaa})(,aaa,aaa) and RRR is an empty string in (aaa,aaa,)(\\text{aaa}, \\text{aaa}, \\text{})(aaa,aaa,)."
      }
    ]
  },
